<metadata preset-name="Chainsaw Choir" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A breathy, resonant choir synth follows your chords and is fed, with the guitar, into a dimed Swedish chainsaw distortion and a small tweed combo. The choir's noise and filter get sawed up with the strings: a buzzing, haunted wall that is one thing, not two. Weld sets how much choir enters the pedal." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
